# Prototipo: laravel/Modules/* e laravel/Themes/*
# Canon: bashscripts/ai/wiki/rules/no-git-lfs.md
# Sync: bash bashscripts/templates/sync-gitattributes-modules.sh
#
# Git LFS VIETATO. Binari = blob git normali.
# Mai: filter=lfs / diff=lfs / merge=lfs
#
# Sui binari solo `binary !filter`. Non aggiungere !merge, !diff o !text:
# !merge riattiva il merge testuale e Git scrive i marker di conflitto negli SVG.

* text=auto
*.css linguist-vendored
*.scss linguist-vendored
*.js linguist-vendored
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore

# Binary files: regular Git blobs; !filter cancels inherited LFS filters.
*.png binary !filter
*.jpg binary !filter
*.jpeg binary !filter
*.gif binary !filter
*.webp binary !filter
*.ico binary !filter
*.svg binary !filter
*.psd binary !filter
*.pdf binary !filter
*.zip binary !filter
*.woff binary !filter
*.woff2 binary !filter
*.ttf binary !filter
*.eot binary !filter
*.otf binary !filter
*.mp4 binary !filter
*.phar binary !filter
*.db binary !filter
*.sqlite binary !filter
